meson: look LLVM up with config-tool on Windows too

method: 'auto' lets meson pick the CMake finder, which walks past the llvm-config given in
the cross file and emits a -L pointing at the build machine's LLVM, leaving every LLVM
symbol undefined at link time.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -2003,7 +2003,7 @@
 
 dep_llvm = dependency(
   'llvm',
-  method : host_machine.system() == 'windows' ? 'auto' : 'config-tool',
+  method : 'config-tool',
   version : _llvm_version,
   modules : llvm_modules,
   optional_modules : llvm_optional_modules,
